# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env; it is already git-ignored.
#
# Optional Postgres connection string for the Phase 0 world data load. The
# pipeline runs to completion without it and prints one line saying so.
#
# CONSTITUTION.md section 4 locks Postgres into the stack, but SPEC.md section 9
# leaves hosting open and agents/README.md records that as unresolved, which is
# why the portable JSON and Parquet exports are produced regardless.
#
# Install the driver first:  pip install 'psycopg[binary]'
WORLD_DATA_POSTGRES_DSN=
